    "expectedRule": "Demon Tower (demon_tower_1) tracks fogPressure 0-3. On the first clear of a monster or trap node that dealt positive damage, fogPressure rises by 1; on the first clear of a relief landmark node (sealed_cache, quiet_prayer_reward) or a successful relief dungeon event (blood_rune_stair, mist_sealed_cache), fogPressure drops by 1; a dungeon event failure that deals damage (blood_rune_stair send_pet_first with no trap-scout pet) also raises fogPressure by 1. fogPressure is clamped to [0,3]. The law display is `雾压 ${fogPressure}/3` with severity stable (0), warning (1-2), danger (3), meter {value: fogPressure, max: 3}, targetReached fogPressure === 0. When fogPressure >= 2 the encounter modifier allStatsPercent is +20 (fog 3) or +10 (fog 2); at fog 0-1 it is 0. Four route gates use fog_pressure_at_most: demon_clear_blood_stair (blood_rune_trap→left_watch_trap, max 0), demon_fog_bone_lane (mist_herb_cache→bone_lane_monster, max 1), demon_clear_portal_stair (lower_fog_lesser→cracked_portal, max 0), demon_hushed_herb_stair (north_supply_niche→mist_herb_cache, max 1). A closed gate rejects run/move with illegal-move and does not change fogPressure. When all four relief landmarks are resolved (2 nodes collected + 2 events resolved) and fogPressure still exceeds a gate's max, the blockReason switches to the exhausted form `雾压需降至 X 或以下；减压地标均已结算，改走白光裂口侧路或撤回。`. Relief landmark rewards are idempotent: a second node/collect-reward is domain-rejected (`雾后暗格已经领取过奖励。` / `静默香案已经领取过奖励。` / `断符石盘已经领取过奖励。`) and a second node/resolve-event is domain-rejected (`这个关卡事件已经结算过，主神不会重复发放奖励。`); re-selecting an already-cleared node is rejected already-resolved. The boss bone_lane_monster (tower_butcher, bossTitle 雾塔剔骨监斩官, sealName 白骨闭门阵, maxHpMultiplier 1.25 → HP 83) starts in sealed phase (attackBonus 1, defenseBonus 1) and awakens to awakened phase (attackBonus 3) at ≤50% HP (血骨开铡); clearing it sets the exit seal 0/1→1/1. Chapter 1 law state is only {kind, fogPressure} and has no law bossSnapshot field (unlike panopticon/combat_replay); the equivalent dynamic evidence frozen here is the boss entry snapshot (HP 83, sealed phase, attack 15, defense 7), the mid-fight awakening (round 3, monsterHp 31, awakened phase), the visible combat consequences (44 damage over 6 rounds), the exit seal transition, and the already-resolved repeat-boss rejection. After the boss fight a pendingEquipmentOffer blocks departure until node/resolve-equipment-loot (no equipmentId = abandon). Law state (fogPressure), display status, clearedNodeIds, resolvedEventIds, and reward points persist through a save-codec round-trip. All expected values are frozen here, never read from candidate code."
  },
